                                  if ((data.pictureDefaultSizeUrl || data.pictureFullSizeUrl) && refId != "onload") {

                                      $("#product-details-fbt li[data-productid=@(Model.Id)]").find(".prdPicture").attr("src",
                                          data.pictureDefaultSizeUrl ? data.pictureDefaultSizeUrl : data.pictureFullSizeUrl);
                                  }

                              }
                              if (data.message) {
                                  alert(data.message);
                              }
                              $(document).trigger({ type: "product_attributes_changed", changedData: data });
                              if ('@Model.EnableConditionalAttributes' == 'True') {
                                  updateAttributeAvailability();
                              }
                          }
                      });
                  }

                  function updateAttributeAvailability() {


                      var attributeContainers = $('@addtoCartFormId .attributes .attribute_value_wrapper');
                      var currentSelections = {};

                      attributeContainers.each(function () {
                          var valId = null;
                          var $checkedInput = $(this).find('input[type="radio"]:checked, input[type="checkbox"]:checked');
                          if ($checkedInput.length > 0) {
                              valId = parseInt($checkedInput.val());
                          } else {
                              var $select = $(this).find('select');
                              if ($select.length > 0 && parseInt($select.val()) > 0) valId = parseInt($select.val());
                          }
                          if (valId && !isNaN(valId)) {
                              currentSelections[$(this).attr('id')] = valId;
                          }
                      });


                      var globalAllowedIds = new Set();
                      validCombinationsList.forEach(function (combo) {
                          combo.forEach(function (id) { globalAllowedIds.add(id); });
                      });

                      // 2. UI Update Loop
                      attributeContainers.each(function (index) {
                          var $container = $(this);
                          var $parentRow = $container.closest('.attribute-row');
                          var currentContainerId = $container.attr('id');

                          var otherSelectedIds = [];
                          attributeContainers.each(function (i) {
                              if (i < index) {
                                  var val = currentSelections[$(this).attr('id')];
                                  if (val) otherSelectedIds.push(val);
                              }
                          });

                          var allowedIds = new Set();
                          if (index === 0) {
                              allowedIds = globalAllowedIds;
                          } else {
                              validCombinationsList.forEach(function (combo) {
                                  if (otherSelectedIds.every(function (id) { return combo.includes(id); })) {
                                      combo.forEach(function (id) { allowedIds.add(id); });
                                  }
                              });
                          }

                          var visibleValuesCount = 0;

                          // A. Swatches (FIXED)
                          $container.find('li[data-attr-value]').each(function () {
                              var valId = parseInt($(this).attr('data-attr-value'));
                              var $input = $(this).find('input');

                              var originalName = $input.attr('data-original-name') || $input.attr('name');
                              if (!$input.attr('data-original-name') && originalName) {
                                  $input.attr('data-original-name', originalName);
                              }

                              $(this).show(); // always visible

                              if (allowedIds.has(valId)) {
                                  $(this).removeClass('unavailable-swatch');
                                  $input.prop('disabled', false);
                                  if (originalName) $input.attr('name', originalName);
                                  visibleValuesCount++; // ✅ ONLY valid
                              } else {
                                  $input.prop('checked', false)
                                      .removeAttr('checked')
                                      .prop('disabled', true)
                                      .removeAttr('name');

                                  $(this).addClass('unavailable-swatch');
                                  $(this).removeClass('selected-value img-selected mz-thumb-selected');
                              }


                          });

                          $container.find('li[data-attr-value]').each(function () {
                              var $checked = $container.find('input:checked:not(:disabled)');

                              if ($checked.length === 0) {
                                  var $firstValid = $container.find('input:not(:disabled)').first();

                                  if ($firstValid.length > 0) {
                                      $firstValid.prop('checked', true).trigger('click');
                                      $container.find('li').removeClass('selected-value');
                                     $firstValid.closest('li').addClass('selected-value');
                                  }
                              }
                          });


                          var $select = $container.find('select');
                          if ($select.length > 0) {
                              var originalSelectName = $select.attr('data-original-name') || $select.attr('name');
                              if (!$select.attr('data-original-name') && originalSelectName) {
                                  $select.attr('data-original-name', originalSelectName);
                              }

                              var $customItemsContainer = $select.siblings('.select-items');

                              $select.find('option').each(function () {
                                  var valId = parseInt($(this).attr('data-attr-value') || $(this).val());
                                  if (!valId || valId === 0) return;

                                  var optionText = $.trim($(this).text());
                                  var $customDiv = $customItemsContainer.find('div').filter(function () {
                                      return $.trim($(this).text()) === optionText;
                                  });

                                  if (allowedIds.has(valId)) {
                                      $(this).prop('disabled', false);
                                      if ($customDiv.length) {
                                          $customDiv.removeClass('unavailable-swatch');
                                      }
                                      visibleValuesCount++;
                                  } else {
                                      if ($(this).is(':selected')) {
                                          $select.val('0');
                                      }

                                      $(this).prop('disabled', true);
                                      if ($customDiv.length) {
                                          $customDiv.addClass('unavailable-swatch');
                                          $customDiv.removeClass('same-as-selected');
                                      }
                                  }
                              });


                              if (visibleValuesCount === 0) { //--
                                  $select.removeAttr('name');
                              } else {
                                  $select.attr('name', originalSelectName);

                                  if ($select.val() === "0" || $select.val() === null) {

                                      var $firstValidOpt = $select.find('option').filter(function () {
                                          return !$(this).prop('disabled') && $(this).val() !== "0";
                                      }).first();

                                      if ($firstValidOpt.length > 0) {
                                          $select.val($firstValidOpt.val()).trigger('change');

                                          var $customSelected = $select.siblings('.select-selected');
                                          if ($customSelected.length > 0) {
                                              $customSelected.html($firstValidOpt.text());
                                              //var $customDiv = $customItemsContainer.find('div').filter(function () {
                                              //    return $.trim($(this).text()) === "Queen"
                                              //});
                                              //alert($customDiv.length);
                                              //if ($customDiv.length > 0) {
                                              //    $customDiv.addClass('same-as-selected');
                                              //}
                                          }
                                      }
                                  }
                              }
                          }

                          $parentRow[0].style.removeProperty('display');
                      });
            }



                  $(document).ready(function () {

                  @(attributeChangeHandlerFuncName)("onload");

                  @Html.Raw(attributeChangeScriptsBuilder.ToString());

                      validCombinationsList = @Html.Raw(Newtonsoft.Json.JsonConvert.SerializeObject(Model.AllCombinations ?? new List<List<int>>()));
                      validCombinationsList = validCombinationsList || [];

                  });
        </script>


    }



}

